  "html": "<p>Occasionally in the game you will find Relic Chests. These hold rare relics that can be handed in to the Banker NPC (<a href=\"/wiki/Tilles_the_Sellout\" title=\"Tilles the Sellout\">Tilles the Sellout</a>) for <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>.\n</p><p>Sometimes when opening a relic chest, a Chest <a href=\"/wiki/Guardians\" title=\"Guardians\">Guardian</a> will be summoned. This is a range attacking mob (uses a gun) who seems to have about as much life as a Hero mob. The guardian will also be accompanied by 4 Summoned Trophies who discharge an energy ranged attack.  They will also get in between your ranged attacks and the Guardian.\n</p><p>The Quests are:\n</p>\n<ul><li> 4 Common <i>things</i> (reward = 5 <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Coins\" title=\"King's Coins\">King's Coins</a>)\n</li><li> 2 Unusual <i>things</i> (reward = 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>)\n</li><li> 1 Amazing <i>thing</i> (reward = 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>)\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Relic_Quest_Items\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Relic Quest Items</span></h2>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr>\n<th><big>Icon</big>\n</th><th><big>Name</big>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from Algornon are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sissirat's_Common_Name_Brand_Bracelet.jpg\" title=\"Sissirat's Common Name Brand Bracelet.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Sissirat's_Common_Name_Brand_Bracelet.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Sissirat's Common Name Brand Bracelet\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Sissirat's_Unusual_Poisoned_Stuffed_Owl.png\" title=\"Sissirat's Unusual Poisoned Stuffed Owl.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Sissirat's_Unusual_Poisoned_Stuffed_Owl.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Sissirat's Unusual Poisoned Stuffed Owl\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sissirat's_Amazing_Cheery_Cup_of_Jo.jpg\" title=\"Sissirat's Amazing Cheery Cup of Jo.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Sissirat's_Amazing_Cheery_Cup_of_Jo.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Sissirat's Amazing Cheery Cup of Jo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from Algor's Terror Dome are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Common_Frozen_Turkey_Leg.png\" title=\"Algor's Common Frozen Turkey Leg.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Common_Frozen_Turkey_Leg.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Algor's Common Frozen Turkey Leg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Unusual_Stinkin_Badge.png\" title=\"Algor's Unusual Stinkin Badge.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Unusual_Stinkin_Badge.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Algor's Unusual Stinkin Badge\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Self-Imitation_Plush_Doll.png\" title=\"Algor's Self-Imitation Plush Doll.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Algor's_Self-Imitation_Plush_Doll.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Algor's Self-Imitation Plush Doll\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from Vergrim's Vexation are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vergrim's_Common_Burglarized_Necklace.jpg\" title=\"Vergrim's Common Burglarized Necklace.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Vergrim's_Common_Burglarized_Necklace.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Vergrim's Common Burglarized Necklace\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vergrim's_Unusual_Certificate_of_Incompletion.jpg\" title=\"Vergrim's Unusual Certificate of Incompletion.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Vergrim's_Unusual_Certificate_of_Incompletion.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Vergrim's Unusual Certificate of Incompletion\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vergrim's_Amazing_Self_Made_Crown.jpg\" title=\"Vergrim's Amazing Self Made Crown.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Vergrim's_Amazing_Self_Made_Crown.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Vergrim's Amazing Self Made Crown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from The Widower's Nest are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Widow_Maker's_Common_Spiced_Wristband.jpg\" title=\"Widow Maker's Common Spiced Wristband.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Widow_Maker's_Common_Spiced_Wristband.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Widow Maker's Common Spiced Wristband\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Widow_Maker's_Unusual_Phishing_Tournament_Plaque.png\" title=\"Widow Maker's Unusual Phishing Tournament Plaque.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Widow_Maker's_Unusual_Phishing_Tournament_Plaque.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Widow Maker's Unusual Phishing Tournament Plaque\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Widow_Maker's_Amazing_Sweetheart_Mug.png\" title=\"Widow Maker's Amazing Sweetheart Mug.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Widow_Maker's_Amazing_Sweetheart_Mug.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Widow Maker's Amazing Sweetheart Mug\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from Frump's Misfortune are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Common_Lucky_Turkey_Leg.png\" title=\"Frumps's Common Lucky Turkey Leg.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Common_Lucky_Turkey_Leg.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Frumps's Common Lucky Turkey Leg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Unusual_Bowling_League_Trophy.png\" title=\"Frumps's Unusual Bowling League Trophy.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Unusual_Bowling_League_Trophy.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Frumps's Unusual Bowling League Trophy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Amazing_Red_Stapler.png\" title=\"Frumps's Amazing Red Stapler.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Frumps's_Amazing_Red_Stapler.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Frumps's Amazing Red Stapler\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from The Mutanous Malaise:\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Common_Triple_Chin_Choker.jpg\" title=\"Rotgut's Common Triple Chin Choker.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Rotgut's_Common_Triple_Chin_Choker.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Rotgut's Common Triple Chin Choker\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Rotgut's_Unusual_Stuffed_Hoot_Owl.png\" title=\"Rotgut's Unusual Stuffed Hoot Owl.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Rotgut's_Unusual_Stuffed_Hoot_Owl.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Rotgut's Unusual Stuffed Hoot Owl\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Amazing_Hotrod_Key.jpg\" title=\"Rotgut's Amazing Hotrod Key.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Rotgut's_Amazing_Hotrod_Key.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Rotgut's Amazing Hotrod Key\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from The Embercore Path are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Abaddon's_Common_Sweatband.jpg\" title=\"Abaddon's Common Sweatband.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Abaddon's_Common_Sweatband.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Abaddon's Common Sweatband\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon's_Unusual_Badge_of_Scorchage.png\" title=\"Abaddon's Unusual Badge of Scorchage.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon's_Unusual_Badge_of_Scorchage.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Abaddon's Unusual Badge of Scorchage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon's_Amazing_Fire_Orok_Plushy_Dolls.png\" title=\"Abaddon's Amazing Fire Orok Plushy Dolls.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon's_Amazing_Fire_Orok_Plushy_Dolls.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Abaddon's Amazing Fire Orok Plushy Dolls\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from The Shadow's Embrace are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Common_Claw.jpg\" title=\"The Shadow Queen's Common Claw.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Common_Claw.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>The Shadow Queen's Common Claw\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Unusual_Relic_Certificate_of_Dishonorable_Mention.jpg\" title=\"The Shadow Queen's Unusual Relic Certificate of Dishonorable Mention.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Unusual_Relic_Certificate_of_Dishonorable_Mention.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>The Shadow Queen's Unusual Relic Certificate of Dishonorable Mention\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Amazing_Paper_Crown.jpg\" title=\"The Shadow Queen's Amazing Paper Crown.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/The_Shadow_Queen.png's_Amazing_Paper_Crown.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>The Shadow Queen's Amazing Paper Crown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"center\"><br/>The relics from Ratsputin's Gulag are:<br/><br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Common_Plastic_Amulet.png\" title=\"Ratsputin's Common Plastic Amulet.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Common_Plastic_Amulet.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Ratsputin's Common Plastic Amulet\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Unusual_Relic_Plaque_of_Under-Achievment.png\" title=\"Ratsputin's Unusual Relic Plaque of Under-Achievment.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Unusual_Relic_Plaque_of_Under-Achievment.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Ratsputin's Unusual Relic Plaque of Under-Achievment\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Amazing_Coffee_Mug.png\" title=\"Ratsputin's Amazing Coffee Mug.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ratsputin's_Amazing_Coffee_Mug.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Ratsputin's Amazing Coffee Mug\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
